{"version":1,"content":"<p>據21世紀經濟報道記者對15家區域性民營銀行的多方核實，截至10月20日，已有14家機構明確叫停或限制個人異地存款相關業務。本次整改系監管屬地化要求的落地執行，存量業務不受即時影響，須按監管時間表於2027年底前完成全部處置。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583280.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:42.083524+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:37:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"87ff71ee7340f5a3a214c2716e0ba1b6fe069dc233d5ddfe7282e8898e03348c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}